 task "check_something", "server4", sub {
   return "foo";
 };

If you want to add custom parameters for the task you can do it this way.

 task "prepare", "server5", sub {
  run_task "check_something", on => "foo", params => { param1 => "value1", param2 => "value2" };
 };

