=over 4

=item * Augeas config file management library L<Rex::Commands::Augeas>

=item * Cloud Management L<Rex::Commands::Cloud>

=item * Cron Management L<Rex::Commands::Cron>

=item * Database Commands L<Rex::Commands::DB>

